ut one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLi Hua is a student who loves plants, and he plants some rare flowers in the school garden. Zhao Min loves photography very much, and she takes pictures of these flowers when she passes by the school garden. Zhang Wei sees Zhao Min taking pictures of the flowers without permission, but because he knows Zhao Min has a difficult family situation and photography is her only hobby, he does not stop her. When Li Hua finds out that someone takes pictures of his flowers and posts them on social media without permission, he starts asking people around him. In the end, Zhao Min finds out that the flowers belong to Li Hua and admits her behavior.\n\n[Question]\nWhat is the possible intention behind Zhao Min's behavior?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhao Min possibly feels jealous of Li Hua's flowers and wants to diminish his sense of achievement by taking and publicizing these flowers.\nB. Zhao Min possibly wants to showcase her photography works on social media to increase her popularity.\nC. Zhao Min takes pictures of the flowers because she plans to steal these photos for online sales.\nD. Zhao Min's behavior possibly stems from her love for photography, and she may not realize the impropriety of taking pictures of other people's property without permission.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e10cd6006945d27fe12b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367756456,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:29:16","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":